            <sampling>
                <studyExtent>
                    <description>
                        <para>Occurrence data were obtained from 48 researchers from all over Ukraine in a form of their publications in the following literature resource: Material to the Mammal Atlas of Ukraine / Series: “Conservation Biology in Ukraine&quot;. – Issue 20. – Kyiv, 2021. – 240 p.</para>
                    </description>
                </studyExtent>
                <samplingDescription>
                    <para>Data were collected, georeferenced, and organized by the authors of each articles on their own. Additional data cleaning and postprocessing were conducted by Oleksii Marushchak.</para>
                </samplingDescription>
            </sampling>
            <qualityControl>
                <description>
